  "description": "Among the various gods of the celestial world, Lang was born as the successor of the god of the night. Lang gets to see the bad things that have happened in the human world at night and thus have bad feelings. The god of day, Hyun, has the light that shines for humans and especially for Lang. Will Lang and Hyun have the happily ever after they deserve?\n\n[Original Webcomic](https://www.mrblue.com/section_webtoon/detail.asp?pid=wt_dayand_wz)",
